~ normal_keeper
Keeper: [sway]At last... the handoff is complete.[]
Keeper: Thirty minutes. Three paths. One person willing to remain in my place.
Keeper: [beat]Now I can leave.[]
=> END

~ normal_rift
Rift: [sway]He deceived you, but not me.[]
Rift: He only forgot that he once stood where you stand.
Rift: The past that chased, the present that fled, the future left blank, the Keeper who waited-
Rift: [jit2 scale=1.0 freq=7.0]They were always the same man.[]
Rift: You asked me to take your past and future.
Rift: [sway]They will return to this cycle. I reflect your wish. Now, forget. Once more.[]
=> END

~ normal_title
UI: [beat]NORMAL ENDING[]
=> END

~ normal_hint
UI: [sway]Collect every heart. There may be another path.[]
=> END

~ normal_run
UI: RUN
=> END

~ normal_continue
UI: CONTINUE
=> END

~ true_acceptance
Rift: [sway]At last, you have stopped running.[]
He: I did not defeat the past.
He: I finally let her finish speaking.
Rift: Acceptance is not revision. Understanding cannot undo what happened.
He: I know. I will not ask you to erase her choice.
He: [beat]Send the future I recorded back. To that cry of RUN.[]
Rift: A wish can only open a path. You must run the rest together.
=> END

~ true_trace
Rift: For the first time, past, present, and future point the same way.
Rift: [sparkle]A path that never existed now exists because you carried it here.[]
=> END

~ true_reunion
He: [beat]Lia.[]
Lia: You remember?
He: Everything. Even the words you never got to finish.
He: [sparkle]This time, we run together.[]
Lia: Then keep up.
=> END

~ true_epilogue
Rift: [sparkle]RUN. I will catch up with you.[]
Rift: This time, neither of them had to run alone.
=> END

~ true_run
UI: RUN
=> END

~ true_return
UI: RETURN TO TITLE
=> END
